chx:Research a res:ResearchProject ; rdfs:label "Keeping time, scheduling tasks and launching programs for an advanced course: chapter 19 and today's time, datetime, zoneinfo, subprocess, cron and Python"@en ;
    sen0414:methodology "Primary source first: the chapter's named concepts from the textbook ontology built over the published chapter. Then the official documentation for the current release and the PEPs the chapter's topics touch. Every source opened and read on 2026-10-13T01:45:00; every claim taken from text actually read; every behaviour executed under Python 3.14.6." ;
    res:hasResearchScope chx:Scope ; rdfs:member chx:P01, chx:P02, chx:P03, chx:P04, chx:P05, chx:P06, chx:P07, chx:P08, chx:P09, chx:P10, chx:P11, chx:P12, chx:P13, chx:P14, chx:P15, chx:P16, chx:P17, chx:P18, chx:P19, chx:P20, chx:P21, chx:P22, chx:P23, chx:P24, chx:P25, chx:P26, chx:P27, chx:P28, chx:P29, chx:P30, chx:P31, chx:P32, chx:P33, chx:P34, chx:P35, chx:P36, chx:P37, chx:P38, chx:P39, chx:P40, chx:P41, chx:P42, chx:P43, chx:P44, chx:P45, chx:P46, chx:P47, chx:P48, chx:P49, chx:P50, chx:P51, chx:P52, chx:P53, chx:P54, chx:P55, chx:P56, chx:P57, chx:P58, chx:P59, chx:P60, chx:P61, chx:P62, chx:P63, chx:P64 .
chx:Scope a res:ResearchScope ; res:hasResearchQuestion "What does chapter 19 of the 3rd edition teach about reading the clock, dates and durations, launching other programs and scheduling them, which of its printed outputs, programs and statements still hold under Python 3.14.6 (with pyperclip 1.11.0, playsound3 3.3.2 and schedule 1.2.2, and with the versions its Appendix A pins), and what must an advanced course correct or add so that it matches the current time, datetime, zoneinfo and subprocess modules, the time zone database and the real behaviour of the operating system's schedulers?" ; res:hasTimeWindow "Current as of 2026-10-13." .
